WEBVTT

00:02.836 --> 00:05.672
I never realized...

00:05.672 --> 00:09.175
On that day... The day
I met Zero and Ichii...

00:09.175 --> 00:13.346
...that one day the day would
come for us to say goodbye...

00:13.346 --> 00:15.348
I must've been taking it for granted.

00:15.348 --> 00:17.350
I must've been taking
their kindness for granted,

00:17.350 --> 00:20.186
and as a result,
I made them get hurt so badly...

00:20.186 --> 00:22.522
I don't want to be
separated from them...

00:22.522 --> 00:27.892
But I can't stand to watch them
being in danger for me any more!

00:30.530 --> 00:31.698
Hey, Nina!

00:31.698 --> 00:33.033
Nina-chan?

00:33.033 --> 00:35.201
Goodbye, Zero... Ichii...

00:35.201 --> 00:38.534
I hope you two become
wonderful sorcerers!

00:39.706 --> 00:41.041
Nina-chan!

00:41.041 --> 00:42.042
Zura...

00:42.042 --> 00:43.376
Nina!

00:43.376 --> 00:45.045
I hope you pass the test.

00:45.045 --> 00:47.213
My princes...

00:47.213 --> 00:49.883
I'm Nina Yamada,

00:49.883 --> 00:53.386
the girl who swallowed
the Crystal Pearl.

00:53.386 --> 00:56.723
But the pearl has finally
been taken out of me...

00:56.723 --> 01:01.061
today, the last day of the test...
Christmas Day!

01:01.061 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:33.486 --> 02:39.159
Wh-What's going to happen...

02:39.159 --> 02:40.827
...to the Crystal Pearl?

02:40.827 --> 02:42.829
What's going on?

02:42.829 --> 02:47.163
If you don't want it I'll take it!

02:56.176 --> 02:58.511
What is this?

02:58.511 --> 03:01.844
I-It sucked my magic power
out of my body...

03:05.351 --> 03:07.020
Defense magic!

03:07.020 --> 03:09.011
Fireball Piston!

03:15.195 --> 03:16.863
Crap!

03:16.863 --> 03:19.365
Everyone's down there! Hurry!

03:19.365 --> 03:22.357
I'm worried about everyone! Hurry!

03:24.204 --> 03:30.877
I never even thought that
the Crystal Pearl from that time...

03:30.877 --> 03:34.214
the Crystal Pearl that
I accidentally swallowed

03:34.214 --> 03:39.208
would do such an unbelievable thing...

03:44.891 --> 03:45.892
Hatsuka!

03:45.892 --> 03:46.881
Yo-chan!

03:48.728 --> 03:53.900
It's okay. They're just sleeping.
Probably they're just unconscious.

03:53.900 --> 03:55.561
But at this rate-

03:59.239 --> 04:00.907
Nina!

04:00.907 --> 04:02.306
Hurry up! Come this way!

04:06.913 --> 04:08.244
Zero!

04:10.416 --> 04:11.610
They're coming!

04:21.928 --> 04:23.259
That's-

04:28.434 --> 04:30.937
Black Crystal Pearl!

04:30.937 --> 04:31.938
- Will?
- Will?

04:31.938 --> 04:33.773
Explain what's going on!

04:33.773 --> 04:35.275
Why are you here?

04:35.275 --> 04:37.977
I noticed the situation down here
when I was in the magic world.

04:37.977 --> 04:40.780
So I hurried here, but...

04:40.780 --> 04:44.951
It seems that something awful
has happened to the Crystal Pearl,

04:44.951 --> 04:48.955
because it was inside
the human's body for so long.

04:48.955 --> 04:50.456
Something awful?

04:50.456 --> 04:52.792
We don't know the exact details,

04:52.792 --> 04:56.796
however normally a pearl
absorbs a sorcerer's power

04:56.796 --> 05:00.466
and grows along with him
then becomes a sorcerer's helper.

05:00.466 --> 05:03.970
But this Crystal Pearl
had no energy to absorb

05:03.970 --> 05:05.805
because it's entered a human's body,

05:05.805 --> 05:09.642
and not only that, it was ejected
while it was still incomplete,

05:09.642 --> 05:12.312
therefore it had to grow on its own.

05:12.312 --> 05:13.980
On its own?

05:13.980 --> 05:16.316
In order to grow...

05:16.316 --> 05:19.986
So it's absorbed the power
from Hatsuka and Yo-chan?

05:19.986 --> 05:22.021
And the power from my teacher
and the others, too?

05:22.021 --> 05:25.491
And if that weren't enough,
the Black Pearl will eventually begin

05:25.491 --> 05:28.828
to absorb the power from
all the creatures in the entire world!

05:28.828 --> 05:31.331
In the entire world?

05:31.331 --> 05:37.003
The power of all the creatures...
Until it sucks it all from this earth!

05:37.003 --> 05:38.671
But if it really did that,

05:38.671 --> 05:41.507
it's going to affect everyone,
not just Hatsuka or Yo-chan!

05:41.507 --> 05:44.010
You must stop the pearl quickly!

05:44.010 --> 05:46.679
Stop it? But how?

05:46.679 --> 05:51.017
All of us... All of us are going
to surround it and seal its movement!

05:51.017 --> 05:52.685
But Ichii-

05:52.685 --> 05:54.020
What is it?

05:54.020 --> 05:57.357
Tell me exactly how we can fight
against it together when it's like this...

05:57.357 --> 05:59.692
Things are looking
pretty uncoordinated zura...

05:59.692 --> 06:02.161
It's fun! It's fun!

06:02.161 --> 06:05.365
Go! Go! We're going
to get our hands on the pearl

06:05.365 --> 06:07.526
and pass the test no matter what!

06:09.369 --> 06:11.037
On, no!

06:11.037 --> 06:14.374
Like I said, Lady Rokka, we must
evacuate from here as soon as possible.

06:14.374 --> 06:16.376
If anything happened to you,

06:16.376 --> 06:18.711
I wouldn't know what to say
to apologize to your father.

06:18.711 --> 06:21.381
But I want to be with Ichii-sama!

06:21.381 --> 06:23.549
I wouldn't like it unless
I'm right by Ichii-sama!

06:23.549 --> 06:24.777
No!

06:34.560 --> 06:36.391
Zero! Ichii!

06:37.063 --> 06:38.398
San-chan!

06:38.398 --> 06:39.399
Forte!

06:39.399 --> 06:41.734
Gou and Rokka, too...

06:41.734 --> 06:46.572
No, I can't take this anymore!!

06:46.572 --> 06:51.077
Zero! Ichii! Don't do this!
Please don't fight anymore!

06:51.077 --> 06:54.247
I can't bear to watch everyone getting
hurt more than they already have!

06:54.247 --> 06:57.917
I don't want to see you two getting hurt
more than you already have!

06:57.917 --> 06:59.585
Zero, you're okay with that, right?

06:59.585 --> 07:02.422
Yeah, we have no choice.

07:02.422 --> 07:05.591
I never thought such a powerful
thing like this would show up.

07:05.591 --> 07:09.262
I thought all our opponents
were just the examinees.

07:09.262 --> 07:11.431
Who would've thought
the most powerful opponent

07:11.431 --> 07:14.100
would turn out to be the Crystal Pearl
used for this very test, huh?

07:14.100 --> 07:15.601
I'm sorry, Ichii.

07:15.601 --> 07:16.769
What?

07:16.769 --> 07:18.771
About the incident in
the principal's office...

07:18.771 --> 07:21.607
I guess you were right after all.

07:21.607 --> 07:23.443
You think you can do it?

07:23.443 --> 07:26.779
Yeah, no matter how hard it is...

07:26.779 --> 07:27.947
Zero.

07:27.947 --> 07:29.949
If that's the best, then...

07:29.949 --> 07:33.119
- lf that would help our Nina-chan!
- lf that would help our Nina!

07:33.119 --> 07:34.120
Ichii...

07:34.120 --> 07:35.121
Go ahead!

07:35.121 --> 07:36.782
Charm Capsule!

07:37.957 --> 07:39.792
Hey, what is this?

07:39.792 --> 07:42.795
Tell me what this is about! Zero, Ichii!

07:42.795 --> 07:44.630
Now you can go somewhere safe.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.465
What?

07:45.465 --> 07:46.799
Somewhere safe?

07:46.799 --> 07:49.302
Listen.

07:49.302 --> 07:52.805
The Crystal Pearl is no longer
inside you, Nina-chan.

07:52.805 --> 07:55.808
So you don't have to be
in danger any longer.

07:55.808 --> 08:00.146
You see, there's no need for you to be
with us if there's no Crystal Pearl.

08:00.146 --> 08:04.484
Zero! Ichii! What do you mean by that?
What are you trying to say?

08:04.484 --> 08:09.148
Nina-chan, you have nothing
to do with us anymore!

08:11.157 --> 08:12.825
Nothing to do with you?

08:12.825 --> 08:14.994
You're in our way, Nina!

08:14.994 --> 08:16.496
You are!

08:16.496 --> 08:18.164
Zero... Zero!

08:18.164 --> 08:20.666
So just hurry up and disappear!

08:20.666 --> 08:23.503
Get out of my sight right now!

08:23.503 --> 08:25.505
Zero! Don't...

08:25.505 --> 08:27.173
Don't say that!

08:27.173 --> 08:29.842
No! I don't want to do that!

08:29.842 --> 08:31.901
No way!

08:35.515 --> 08:36.349
Zero...

08:36.349 --> 08:41.687
I know! I know this
is the best way to do this!

08:41.687 --> 08:44.357
I know that, but-

08:44.357 --> 08:48.194
I can't believe we had to part
from her like this for that thing!

08:48.194 --> 08:50.856
For that damn thing!

08:53.533 --> 08:55.201
No...

08:55.201 --> 08:56.202
No!

08:56.202 --> 08:59.539
You have nothing to do with us anymore!

08:59.539 --> 09:00.540
You are!

09:00.540 --> 09:02.041
Nothing to do with you?

09:02.041 --> 09:04.532
You're in our way, Nina!

09:11.551 --> 09:13.883
Magic Cannon!

09:16.556 --> 09:17.223
Shit!

09:17.223 --> 09:19.892
It's no use, Zero!
Magic won't work on it!

09:19.892 --> 09:21.727
It only gives it more power instead!

09:21.727 --> 09:24.218
Then what am I supposed to do, Ichii?

09:48.087 --> 09:50.923
Zero! Ichii!

09:50.923 --> 09:54.594
The Crystal Pearl is no longer
inside you, Nina-chan.

09:54.594 --> 09:57.256
You have nothing to do with us anymore!

09:58.598 --> 10:00.589
You're in our way!

10:01.601 --> 10:05.605
Am I really in their way?

10:05.605 --> 10:08.597
Am I just a burden now?

10:09.609 --> 10:13.613
No, Zero... Ichii...

10:13.613 --> 10:15.444
No!

10:38.304 --> 10:41.307
Zero! Ichii!

10:41.307 --> 10:43.643
Are you okay?

10:43.643 --> 10:45.645
You are...

10:45.645 --> 10:47.313
Riru!

10:47.313 --> 10:48.981
Hey, tell me something!

10:48.981 --> 10:51.484
You can see the future, can't you?

10:51.484 --> 10:53.319
Are Zero and Ichii going to win?

10:53.319 --> 10:55.988
Will they be able to capture that pearl?

10:55.988 --> 10:59.325
And what did you mean by no one
would pass the sorcery test?

10:59.325 --> 11:02.495
You said I'd never see
Zero and Ichii forever-

11:02.495 --> 11:04.997
Hey, does it mean something's going
to happen to Zero and Ichii?

11:04.997 --> 11:06.165
I don't know.

11:06.165 --> 11:08.668
But you did say that, remember?

11:08.668 --> 11:10.670
You said that's what's going
to happen in the future!

11:10.670 --> 11:12.838
Actually that's not very clear.

11:12.838 --> 11:15.675
Right now I can no longer
see the definite future.

11:15.675 --> 11:17.009
What do you mean?

11:17.009 --> 11:20.513
I don't know.
I don't even know myself,

11:20.513 --> 11:23.182
but that probably means
that the future might change...

11:23.182 --> 11:26.686
...depending on the action you,
an outsider, take.

11:26.686 --> 11:30.856
My... My action will change the future?

11:30.856 --> 11:34.360
That's what the future indicates.

11:34.360 --> 11:36.028
If that's the case, what should I do?

11:36.028 --> 11:41.193
If my action could change
the future, what would I do?

11:43.202 --> 11:46.372
I don't want to be away from them.
I don't want to be apart from them!

11:46.372 --> 11:49.709
Until the very end I want
to be with everyone!

11:49.709 --> 11:51.043
With Zero and Ichii!

11:51.043 --> 11:53.212
Hey, are you sure about that?

11:53.212 --> 11:55.715
It's obvious that danger
awaits you if you go back!

11:55.715 --> 11:57.550
So are you still-

11:57.550 --> 11:58.551
Yes!

11:58.551 --> 12:02.388
No matter what kind of fate
awaits me there,

12:02.388 --> 12:06.225
I still want to feel everyone
until the last moment!

12:06.225 --> 12:09.228
I want to continue to have faith in them!

12:09.228 --> 12:13.399
I want to be with everyone!
I don't want to be away from them!

12:13.399 --> 12:15.067
That's all!

12:15.067 --> 12:16.569
Hey, Nina!

12:16.569 --> 12:18.904
That's right! I don't want to be alone!

12:18.904 --> 12:22.241
Even if they refuse me
or tell me I'm in their way,

12:22.241 --> 12:23.743
I still want to be with everyone!

12:23.743 --> 12:26.412
I want to be with Zero and Ichii!

12:26.412 --> 12:28.437
That's all I want!

12:34.086 --> 12:35.254
Defense magic!

12:35.254 --> 12:37.245
It's not going to work, Ichii!

12:40.760 --> 12:44.263
It's no use... We're no match for that.

12:44.263 --> 12:46.432
How could we let the stuff like that...

12:46.432 --> 12:49.924
This is completely crazy...
Isn't that right, Nina?

12:51.437 --> 12:56.108
Damn it! Why can't we win?
Against stuff like that?

12:56.108 --> 12:58.277
Against stuff like that on that level?

12:58.277 --> 13:02.448
Why? Why?

13:02.448 --> 13:04.784
Zero! Ichii!

13:04.784 --> 13:05.785
That's Nina zura!

13:05.785 --> 13:08.287
What? Nina?

13:08.287 --> 13:09.288
Nina!

13:09.288 --> 13:11.957
Zero! Ichii!

13:11.957 --> 13:14.126
She's back!

13:14.126 --> 13:15.628
Nina-chan!

13:15.628 --> 13:17.797
Zero! Ichii!

13:17.797 --> 13:19.128
Zero!

13:20.299 --> 13:22.468
- She's back!
- She's back!

13:22.468 --> 13:24.129
- Nina is back!
- Nina-chan is back!

13:29.475 --> 13:31.143
Nina...

13:31.143 --> 13:32.812
What do you think you're doing, Nina?

13:32.812 --> 13:34.814
We told you to go home
because it's dangerous, didn't we?

13:34.814 --> 13:37.817
Even if you come here,
you have nothing to do with this

13:37.817 --> 13:39.485
because you don't have
the Crystal Pearl anymore!

13:39.485 --> 13:41.654
You're just going to end up
dragging us down, so stay out of it!

13:41.654 --> 13:43.489
What do you mean,
I'm going to drag you down?

13:43.489 --> 13:46.992
You're the one who's been
beat up and completely worn out!

13:46.992 --> 13:48.160
What did you just say?

13:48.160 --> 13:50.162
But it's dangerous here, so you
need to get out of here quick!

13:50.162 --> 13:51.163
I don't want to!

13:51.163 --> 13:53.499
How could I be the
only one to run? No way!

13:53.499 --> 13:54.500
What?

13:54.500 --> 13:57.169
I do have something to do with this!

13:57.169 --> 13:59.672
Because I've been with
you guys all this time!

13:59.672 --> 14:01.841
All of us have been living
together all this time!

14:01.841 --> 14:07.680
I just can't be separated from you that
easily because the Crystal Pearl is gone!

14:07.680 --> 14:12.384
We had arguments and stuff, and there
were times I thought, "Why me?" but...

14:12.384 --> 14:14.520
Zero, Ichii and Zura...

14:14.520 --> 14:15.988
San and Forte...

14:15.988 --> 14:17.523
And Gou and Rokka...

14:17.523 --> 14:20.359
And Nanase and Yakumo, too...

14:20.359 --> 14:22.862
All of you are my precious friends!

14:22.862 --> 14:25.698
All of you are my precious people!

14:25.698 --> 14:27.867
So I want to be with you guys!

14:27.867 --> 14:30.202
I might not be able to do anything,

14:30.202 --> 14:34.039
but just like you guys
have protected me,

14:34.039 --> 14:36.208
I want to protect all of you, too!

14:36.208 --> 14:40.446
I want to be there for you, too!

14:40.446 --> 14:43.549
I don't possess any power like you guys,

14:43.549 --> 14:46.886
but my feelings to care about all of you
are much greater than anyone else's!

14:46.886 --> 14:49.955
I'm positive no one can
outdo me when it comes to that!

14:49.955 --> 14:53.893
You're right, and I guess
we didn't realize that.

14:53.893 --> 14:54.727
What?

14:54.727 --> 14:56.061
We've been distant from you
because the idea of parting from you

14:56.061 --> 14:57.897
was too much to bear, but...

14:57.897 --> 15:00.366
We should've never
forgotten about you, Nina!

15:00.366 --> 15:05.404
Because we have grown stronger
by caring for others.

15:05.404 --> 15:07.573
That's how it's been and
it will stay that way always!

15:07.573 --> 15:10.743
That's right, it wasn't really us who've
been protecting Nina all this time.

15:10.743 --> 15:15.247
It was our wish to protect
you and be with you

15:15.247 --> 15:17.583
that made me strong!

15:17.583 --> 15:19.251
- So we will protect Nina
- So we will protect Nina-chan

15:19.251 --> 15:21.587
- with everything we've got
- with everything we've got

15:21.587 --> 15:23.422
- until the very last moment!
- until the very last moment!

15:23.422 --> 15:29.918
And I want to protect these
best people with all I have, too!

15:31.597 --> 15:33.258
Not so fast!

15:34.934 --> 15:36.268
Defense magic!

15:36.268 --> 15:38.259
- Crystal Barrier!
- Crystal Barrier!

15:42.274 --> 15:43.609
We will not lose!

15:43.609 --> 15:45.277
We won't!

15:45.277 --> 15:46.278
San!

15:46.278 --> 15:47.279
Forte!

15:47.279 --> 15:50.449
I don't want the Crystal Pearl anymore!

15:50.449 --> 15:52.952
There are things that are more
important than that, you know!

15:52.952 --> 15:54.286
That's right!

15:54.286 --> 15:56.789
It's okay even if he can't be with me!

15:56.789 --> 15:58.958
And it's okay even if
I can't get his attention.

15:58.958 --> 16:01.827
I just want to protect Ichii-sama!

16:01.827 --> 16:05.798
I understand so well
how you feel, Lady Rokka.

16:05.798 --> 16:08.634
- I agree!
- Nanase! Yakumo!

16:08.634 --> 16:12.972
I want to protect someone
I love, too! Right, Nina?

16:12.972 --> 16:15.975
Let's do this, for my cute little Nina!

16:15.975 --> 16:18.377
- For the people who're dear to us!
- For the people who're dear to us!

16:18.377 --> 16:20.145
Shit!

16:20.145 --> 16:23.515
Nina, can I ask you
the question again zura?

16:23.515 --> 16:26.485
Do you have the person right now zura?

16:26.485 --> 16:30.990
The person you want to protect or
the person you've ever been protected by.

16:30.990 --> 16:34.827
I do! That's my dad and mom!

16:34.827 --> 16:38.831
Whenever I hurt myself or got sick...

16:38.831 --> 16:41.000
They were always
much more worried about me

16:41.000 --> 16:43.335
than they'd ever worry
about themselves...

16:43.335 --> 16:46.005
- Please! Help Nina! Help my daughter!
- They were always protecting me.

16:46.005 --> 16:49.008
- She's our precious daughter!
- They were always protecting me.

16:49.008 --> 16:54.680
But that does mean my dad, mom
and I were strong from the beginning.

16:54.680 --> 16:58.017
I was born and they
didn't know anything...

16:58.017 --> 17:01.020
They gradually became stronger
as they learned by mistake.

17:01.020 --> 17:04.857
They made mistakes...
They got scolded, but still...

17:04.857 --> 17:07.026
It's all because they loved me!

17:07.026 --> 17:10.362
They're holding on with all their might.

17:10.362 --> 17:14.033
Because they want to protect what
they love by doing whatever it takes!

17:14.033 --> 17:17.036
At least what's precious to them!

17:17.036 --> 17:19.038
Zero! Ichii!

17:19.038 --> 17:21.707
I want to share the feeling with you!

17:21.707 --> 17:23.042
With all of you!

17:23.042 --> 17:25.044
With San and Forte!

17:25.044 --> 17:28.714
With Gou, Rokka and everyone else!

17:28.714 --> 17:31.617
I want to share this feeling!

17:31.617 --> 17:33.886
To protect the people
who're dear to me!

17:33.886 --> 17:36.548
- To support the person's dream!
- To support the person's dream!

17:49.568 --> 17:52.571
And I want to save you, too!

17:52.571 --> 17:54.573
This is not about the friend and foe.

17:54.573 --> 17:57.910
I just want to protect
everyone in this world!

17:57.910 --> 17:59.745
Zero!

17:59.745 --> 18:01.580
Use the Magic Cannon!

18:01.580 --> 18:03.571
Take this!

18:07.252 --> 18:08.754
And Ichii!

18:08.754 --> 18:13.919
Use your power and switch it
to the opposite energy!

18:26.605 --> 18:29.942
Come here... Fear no more...

18:29.942 --> 18:33.278
Because, look at this light...

18:33.278 --> 18:38.117
The light that enfolds you
and protects you

18:38.117 --> 18:41.954
is so gentle and warm like this...

18:41.954 --> 18:43.789
It's very warm!

18:43.789 --> 18:44.790
Nina...

18:44.790 --> 18:46.125
Nina-chan...

18:46.125 --> 18:54.633
I'm happy... Because everyone's feeling
is so gentle and warm like this! Right?

18:54.633 --> 18:56.468
It's good as long as you know it.

18:56.468 --> 18:59.304
There's nothing else left for me to say.

18:59.304 --> 19:03.142
Because the idea of destruction
and passing the test

19:03.142 --> 19:06.145
doesn't create the true magical power.

19:06.145 --> 19:09.148
Instead, the desire to protect
what's precious to you

19:09.148 --> 19:12.651
without distinction of friends
and foes creates it.

19:12.651 --> 19:17.156
Nina, you are not a sorcerer,
but the feeling you have

19:17.156 --> 19:20.492
doesn't have anything to do with
whether you're a sorcerer or a human.

19:20.492 --> 19:23.162
Because it is good enough
as long as you have the desire

19:23.162 --> 19:25.164
that you want to protect it.

19:25.164 --> 19:27.666
Zero, Ichii, congratulations.

19:27.666 --> 19:32.171
With your kindness, I'm sure you'll be
able to accomplish anything in the future.

19:32.171 --> 19:34.840
And San, Forte, I'd like
to congratulate you two also.

19:34.840 --> 19:37.176
You two continue to support each other.

19:37.176 --> 19:41.013
Gou, Rokka, and Nanase, Yakumo.

19:41.013 --> 19:43.182
You should be proud as well,

19:43.182 --> 19:50.189
because this power you have activated
is the most beautiful thing in the world!

19:50.189 --> 19:51.356
So, Will, you mean...

19:51.356 --> 19:53.192
Of course you passed.

19:53.192 --> 19:56.862
I will name all of you as professional
sorcerers in the next season!

19:56.862 --> 19:58.197
We did it!

19:58.197 --> 19:59.865
So that means we all are going to be-

19:59.865 --> 20:01.533
Professionals!

20:01.533 --> 20:04.195
If that's the case, when we
go back to the magic world-

20:06.205 --> 20:10.209
Zero... Ichii... I'm not sad.

20:10.209 --> 20:14.046
Because your dreams have come true!

20:14.046 --> 20:16.048
- Nina!
- Nina-chan!

20:16.048 --> 20:18.550
Zero! Ichii!

20:18.550 --> 20:19.885
Congratulations!

20:19.885 --> 20:22.387
I hope you become wonderful sorcerers!

20:22.387 --> 20:26.558
I want you to become nice sorcerers
that can protect everyone's dreams!

20:26.558 --> 20:27.893
- Nina.
- Nina-chan.

20:27.893 --> 20:32.898
Ichii, thank you. You helped me out
with the studying a whole lot.

20:32.898 --> 20:38.570
Once you're gone, I'll oversleep
and be late for school, you know!

20:38.570 --> 20:39.905
Zero!

20:39.905 --> 20:45.244
Thank you. You have always protected
me with everything you've got.

20:45.244 --> 20:48.247
It's going to be pretty quiet around here
because I won't have anyone to argue with!

20:48.247 --> 20:50.582
Zero! Ichii!

20:50.582 --> 20:55.254
I will never forget the days
I have lived with you two

20:55.254 --> 20:58.590
and the fact that you have
protected me very diligently!

20:58.590 --> 21:01.593
About how we laughed, cried, got upset,

21:01.593 --> 21:04.263
the trip to the beach
and the courage test...

21:04.263 --> 21:07.266
We made so many fun memories together!

21:07.266 --> 21:09.434
I will remember it all no matter
how painful it is to me!

21:09.434 --> 21:13.772
Because you two are my ideal guys...

21:13.772 --> 21:16.608
My princes!

21:16.608 --> 21:17.442
Nina-chan...

21:17.442 --> 21:18.610
Nina...

21:18.610 --> 21:23.615
Thank you! Thank you for caring
about me so much and so warmly!

21:23.615 --> 21:24.616
- Nina.
- Nina-chan.

21:24.616 --> 21:27.953
Thank you, Zero! Ichii!

21:27.953 --> 21:29.121
Thank you...

21:29.121 --> 21:31.112
Well, I guess it's time.

21:32.624 --> 21:35.961
The clock will soon
indicate the end of today.

21:35.961 --> 21:39.798
The 12 o'clock,
which means the end of the test.

21:39.798 --> 21:44.102
But I want all of you
to remember the moment.

21:44.102 --> 21:48.307
It is not the end, but the new
beginning for all of you.

21:48.307 --> 21:49.641
Will...

21:49.641 --> 21:53.145
I want all of you to remember
to look at the same clock

21:53.145 --> 21:54.980
at the same time next year and go,

21:54.980 --> 21:57.649
"Phew, I guess I managed
to pass the makeup test!"

21:57.649 --> 22:00.652
- What? What do you mean by that?
- What? What do you mean by that?

22:00.652 --> 22:03.655
That means... I did say,
"You've passed the test!",

22:03.655 --> 22:05.824
but there are actually
some makeup tests, too!

22:05.824 --> 22:06.825
- What?
- What?

22:06.825 --> 22:07.993
- What!?
- What!?

22:07.993 --> 22:09.328
Makeup tests?

22:09.328 --> 22:10.662
That's right!

22:10.662 --> 22:13.332
Your objective is to grow
that little thing,

22:13.332 --> 22:17.336
which Nina-chan has saved,
into a full-fledged sorcerer's helper

22:17.336 --> 22:20.339
by the end of December 24th next year.

22:20.339 --> 22:22.874
That's the makeup test
for this test for all of you!

22:22.874 --> 22:24.676
You see, it can't be helped!

22:24.676 --> 22:29.348
Because Nina-chan isn't a sorcerer,
so everyone has to help her!

22:29.348 --> 22:32.351
- What? All of us?
- What? All of us?

22:32.351 --> 22:38.690
So, Will, does that mean all of us
will get to be with Nina next year, too?

22:38.690 --> 22:39.858
- All of us!
- All of us!

22:39.858 --> 22:41.693
- With Nina-chan?
- With Nina-chan?

22:41.693 --> 22:43.024
Exactly!

22:46.865 --> 22:48.700
Nina-chan.

22:48.700 --> 22:53.038
That's my Christmas gift for you.
Is that okay with you?

22:53.038 --> 22:57.376
Will! It's the best!
It's the best Christmas gift!

22:57.376 --> 23:01.046
Nina, I'm happy because you're happy.

23:01.046 --> 23:03.048
Merry Christmas, Nina.

23:03.048 --> 23:06.385
Well then, please take care
of this sorcerer's helper.

23:06.385 --> 23:08.220
Merry Christmas to you, too, Will!

23:08.220 --> 23:12.891
All right, I will work together
with Zero and Ichii,

23:12.891 --> 23:17.062
and be sure to protect him until he
becomes a full-fledged sorcerer's helper!

23:17.062 --> 23:20.725
And of course, with the
help of everyone here, too!

23:22.067 --> 23:24.069
- Merry Christmas, Nina!
- Merry Christmas, Nina!

23:24.069 --> 23:26.738
So which one have you decided on?
Is it Zero or Ichii-kun?

23:26.738 --> 23:30.075
Hatsuka, Yo-chan, Merry Christmas!

23:30.075 --> 23:33.745
I can't decide it, but I'm very happy,

23:33.745 --> 23:37.249
because they will still
be here next year!

23:37.249 --> 23:40.980
My wonderful princes
will still be here!

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.226
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:05.103 --> 25:10.775
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

25:10.775 --> 25:17.148
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

25:17.148 --> 25:23.021
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

25:23.021 --> 25:28.793
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:28.793 --> 25:34.733
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:34.733 --> 25:40.603
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!
